    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chamy Ball is a 2D level-based puzzle platformer with simple and intuitive game controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/c1660823e41f841a34e12a18a2295d3d.poster.avif?t=1748272237\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/c1660823e41f841a34e12a18a2295d3d.webm?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/c1660823e41f841a34e12a18a2295d3d.mp4?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A love to be saved</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chamy and Amy, two chameleons in love, are enjoying a romantic moment in the grove, but they are being watched by Rusty, another chubby chameleon who is in love with Amy and jealous of their relationship. Blinded by envy, Rusty uses his mysterious magical medallion to cast a spell, turning Chamy into a ball. However, his plan backfires when Chamy starts bouncing toward him, forcing him to flee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/a4365ae5cfa1e159e843cba44e985b99.poster.avif?t=1748272237\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/a4365ae5cfa1e159e843cba44e985b99.webm?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/a4365ae5cfa1e159e843cba44e985b99.mp4?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Change colors!</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To slow Chamy's advance, Rusty creates special colored gems using his medallion. However, this is not enough to stop our hero, who can in fact destroy these gems by simply touching them; to do so, he must be the same color as his target! To catch up with his rival, Chamy will then also have to go in search of the giant flowers scattered around the game world and use them to change his color at every opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/16f9ed706e33b376b4874e6ef30d0a55.avif?t=1748272237\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Full of new features</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, the player will face new challenges using mechanics that are always new. In fact, Chamy can use one special power at a time, such as a super dash or even shot to get rid of his enemies even more easily. Find the key to open the door that will lead you to your next destination, reach the end of each world so you can finally face your rival Rusty and his giant bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this seasoned with a small but crucial twist to the normal platformer experience. Chamy will never stop bouncing!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chamy Ball is a 2D level-based puzzle platformer with simple and intuitive game controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/c1660823e41f841a34e12a18a2295d3d.poster.avif?t=1748272237\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/c1660823e41f841a34e12a18a2295d3d.webm?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/c1660823e41f841a34e12a18a2295d3d.mp4?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>A love to be saved</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chamy and Amy, two chameleons in love, are enjoying a romantic moment in the grove, but they are being watched by Rusty, another chubby chameleon who is in love with Amy and jealous of their relationship. Blinded by envy, Rusty uses his mysterious magical medallion to cast a spell, turning Chamy into a ball. However, his plan backfires when Chamy starts bouncing toward him, forcing him to flee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/a4365ae5cfa1e159e843cba44e985b99.poster.avif?t=1748272237\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/a4365ae5cfa1e159e843cba44e985b99.webm?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/a4365ae5cfa1e159e843cba44e985b99.mp4?t=1748272237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Change colors!</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To slow Chamy's advance, Rusty creates special colored gems using his medallion. However, this is not enough to stop our hero, who can in fact destroy these gems by simply touching them; to do so, he must be the same color as his target! To catch up with his rival, Chamy will then also have to go in search of the giant flowers scattered around the game world and use them to change his color at every opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695040/extras/16f9ed706e33b376b4874e6ef30d0a55.avif?t=1748272237\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Full of new features</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, the player will face new challenges using mechanics that are always new. In fact, Chamy can use one special power at a time, such as a super dash or even shot to get rid of his enemies even more easily. Find the key to open the door that will lead you to your next destination, reach the end of each world so you can finally face your rival Rusty and his giant bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this seasoned with a small but crucial twist to the normal platformer experience. Chamy will never stop bouncing!</p>",
    "short_description": "Jump into a colorful 2D puzzle adventure as Chamy, a chameleon turned into a goofy bouncing ball! Switch colors to smash the gems blocking his way, overcome tricky challenges, and break the spell to help him return to his true form!",
